            <span class="eyebrow">Health Check</span>
            <h2>Real-time API uptime & latency inspector</h2>
            <p>Calls <code>/api/health</code> to measure response latency and confirm server connectivity.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="docs-card docs-status-card">
            <div class="docs-action-row">
              <button class="button button-secondary" type="button" data-api-health-check data-endpoint="<%= safeHealthEndpoint %>">
